            "description": {
              "content": "Records an event that is not associated with a known customer profile. Anonymous events can be merged with a customer profile later when the person is identified, if event merging is enabled in your workspace. Anonymous events recorded within the last 30 days can be associated with a person when their anonymous_id matches.",
